WEBVTT

00:01:34.940 --> 00:01:43.790
In ancient times, when the ancestor of the Queen descended from Ephon Noha to Tahai Aze,

00:01:44.900 --> 00:01:48.860
the kingdoms of the land were on the verge of perishing,

00:01:48.860 --> 00:01:53.000
due to the war which caused a low populace and infertile land.

00:01:55.970 --> 00:02:00.650
When the Founding King walked through the field littered with corpses,

00:02:00.650 --> 00:02:07.560
above him, a Beast Lord that usually would not be tame to humans, flew as if it were protecting him.

00:02:08.360 --> 00:02:15.540
Also in the water were Touda with sharp, venomous fangs, that bowed their heads to him, and gave him way.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:22.300
The people met the Founding King, Je, who was tall and had golden eyes.

00:02:22.300 --> 00:02:26.210
It was the holy God Himself.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:34.030
So many thousands of days and nights later,

00:02:34.800 --> 00:02:38.780
since the capital governed by the Queen does not have an army,

00:02:38.780 --> 00:02:41.240
it is now currently protected by the Grand Duke,

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:45.060
who possesses an army that specializes in Touda, and technically governs the quarters on the other side of the mountains.

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:55.860
The Fighting Beast

00:02:58.230 --> 00:03:02.880
Tomorrow, training for Touda will take place.

00:03:03.220 --> 00:03:08.420
Even so, today, the village is busier than usual.

00:03:09.320 --> 00:03:19.570
That's because the Grand Duke and a high figure from the capital are going to come and watch the training.

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.430
I have to hurry.

00:03:25.590 --> 00:03:27.280
I have to hurry.

00:03:34.060 --> 00:03:36.880
Oh, look.  Erin-chan, you're up early.

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:38.610
Ah, Chok's mother.

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:41.490
Where are you going in such a rush?

00:03:41.490 --> 00:03:45.100
Our Chok is still snoring, you know.

00:03:45.100 --> 00:03:48.020
I need to go take care of Lulu at the grotto.

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.960
So I have to hurry.

00:03:49.960 --> 00:03:50.940
"Lulu?"

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.920
Ah, you mean that baby Touda?

00:03:53.920 --> 00:03:57.840
I named it Lulu since it goes, "Lu~lulu."

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.550
See you, Oba-san.

00:04:00.850 --> 00:04:06.990
It's amazing that the Chief allows Erin to go into the grotto.

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:08.440
Yeah.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:12.830
There are those who don't trust her since she's a child of the Mist People.

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:14.350
But she's Soyon's daughter,

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:15.910
so there's nothing to worry about.

00:04:24.810 --> 00:04:29.120
Hey, mom.  You'll be going to tomorrow's training too, right?

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:31.490
Can I go with you to watch?

00:04:32.130 --> 00:04:36.000
You can't.  You'll need permission from your grandfather.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:40.140
I finished all the mending that had piled up this morning.

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:43.340
I finished making tomorrow's batch of polish balls, too.

00:04:43.820 --> 00:04:47.430
Let's go, Erin.  The Touda's about to wake up.

00:04:59.390 --> 00:04:59.940
There we go.

00:05:21.090 --> 00:05:24.290
Why doesn't the mute whistle have any effect on Lulu?

00:05:24.740 --> 00:05:26.800
Take a look at Lulu's ears.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.810
There's something on it.

00:05:30.050 --> 00:05:31.440
It looks like a lid.

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.670
It's called an "ear-web."

00:05:33.670 --> 00:05:37.920
When their ears are plugged with those, they're unable
to hear the sound of the mute whistle.

00:05:40.260 --> 00:05:43.200
Do they lose their ear-webs when they become adults?

00:05:43.900 --> 00:05:48.830
We cut them off before they become adults and develop claws and fangs.

00:05:49.850 --> 00:05:51.170
Lulu's, too?

00:05:51.170 --> 00:05:53.050
You'll cut them off?

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:55.050
Eventually.

00:05:58.270 --> 00:06:00.760
You can't do that.  It'll hurt.

00:06:01.910 --> 00:06:07.850
You're right.  But if we don't, Touda can't live among humans.

00:06:08.270 --> 00:06:10.560
We must abide by the code.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:23.810
This is the Grand Duke's castle.

00:06:23.810 --> 00:06:29.990
The Grand Duke is the most important warrior who protects the Queen.

00:06:30.930 --> 00:06:34.930
The Queen's relative has arrived at his castle.

00:06:41.860 --> 00:06:46.430
We welcome you, and thank you for coming all the way here, Damiya-sama.

00:06:47.110 --> 00:06:49.140
It has been a while, Grand Duke.

00:06:49.700 --> 00:06:54.530
Thank you for accepting my sudden request this time.

00:06:55.430 --> 00:06:57.220
It's not a problem.

00:06:57.220 --> 00:07:03.930
It is a great honor to have the Queen's nephew observe our Touda.

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:07.680
You're Shunan and Ngan, right?

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:09.510
Please.  Raise your heads.

00:07:09.830 --> 00:07:12.870
Formality is unnecessary to me.

00:07:13.610 --> 00:07:14.980
Excuse us, then.

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:24.000
Damiya-sama.  My oldest son, Shunan, will be given a Touda at tomorrow's training.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.520
Oh!  That's wonderful.

00:07:26.520 --> 00:07:28.060
How old are you?

00:07:28.060 --> 00:07:30.770
Yes.  I'm sixteen, sir.

00:07:31.150 --> 00:07:38.230
I'm sure that the Queen and Seimiya-sama over at the capital would rejoice if they were to see you right now.

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:48.310
The Queen, who is also my aunt, and Seimiya-sama, the successor of the throne, cannot travel as they wish.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:53.750
So a heroic tale like yours, who is the most probable successor to the Grand Duke, will be a great report to take back with me.

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:54.990
Yes, sir.

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:59.840
Given the opportunity, I would like to visit the Holy Shrine, too.

00:08:00.530 --> 00:08:05.190
I will pass your heart of loyalty on to Her Highness.

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:12.220
With all due respect, I would like to show my loyalty to Her Highness myself.

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:22.650
You're blessed with a very diligent successor, Grand Duke.

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:31.910
Yes.  If Shunan grows up to be a fine man, then I'll be able to give him my position without any worries.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:40.370
By the way, Grand Duke, what do you think about also putting Ngan on a Touda during tomorrow's training?

00:08:41.440 --> 00:08:42.780
Ngan, too, you say?

00:08:44.850 --> 00:08:46.210
However...

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:51.220
They say that the Grand Duke's son becomes a true man on a Touda's back.

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:56.630
He has the absolute right to do so, doesn't he, Grand Duke?

00:08:58.890 --> 00:08:59.810
Yes.

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:02.170
Then I will arrange it so.

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:16.060
Upsie-daisy.

00:09:18.350 --> 00:09:19.860
Smells good.

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:31.460
If you lick that, you'll go numb to the tips of your toes.

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:38.550
I'm sorry.

00:09:38.550 --> 00:09:44.910
That's called "tritip grass," and it's used to make a Touda's body bigger and sturdier.

00:09:44.910 --> 00:09:47.950
So you put this in benetrophic water?

00:09:47.950 --> 00:09:48.900
That's right.

00:10:01.470 --> 00:10:03.330
We don't have much left, do we?

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.420
We'll have to go get some more soon.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:07.750
Then I'll go get some.

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.630
Can I, mom?

00:10:11.050 --> 00:10:15.640
If I can't watch the training, then I can go gather the ingredients for benetrophic water.

00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:18.940
I suppose.

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:20.830
Then will you do it for me?

00:10:43.050 --> 00:10:46.540
How admirable of you to train alone at this late an hour.

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:49.590
I knew I was looking at the right man.

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:55.760
I was only getting my spirits high to fulfill the important role that you've bestowed upon me.

00:10:56.980 --> 00:11:00.190
It looks like you've inherited your father's serious side.

00:11:01.290 --> 00:11:03.080
Is there something which brings you out so late?

00:11:03.980 --> 00:11:08.390
I have some business with a beautiful attendant that you have here.

00:11:10.530 --> 00:11:13.160
I also wanted to have a talk with you.

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:14.460
With me?

00:11:14.460 --> 00:11:15.360
Why?

00:11:15.660 --> 00:11:17.880
To me, women and warriors are the same.

00:11:17.880 --> 00:11:23.420
I'm good at spotting raw materials that will shine if polished.

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:27.120
Your brother is a wise boy,

00:11:27.540 --> 00:11:33.020
but you have a born talent and a refined aspiration which surpasses his.

00:11:34.690 --> 00:11:37.970
Just like the first Grand Duke who saved this country from crisis...

00:11:38.850 --> 00:11:41.060
Yaman Hasal.

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:56.820
Please don't let go of that precious heart.

00:12:11.200 --> 00:12:12.420
It's a togera hopper.

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:16.130
Chok.  Stop playing around and get to work.

00:12:16.130 --> 00:12:18.170
We're looking for the ingredients to make benetrophic water.

00:12:18.660 --> 00:12:20.370
I <i>am</i> working.

00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:24.260
But I never thought we'd come this deep into the forest.

00:12:26.660 --> 00:12:28.770
Erin-chan!

00:12:28.770 --> 00:12:29.650
Look.

00:12:29.980 --> 00:12:31.560
Tritip grass.

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:33.730
They're not, Saju-chan.

00:12:33.730 --> 00:12:38.070
See?  Tritip grass has its tip split into three.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:42.240
Oh, you're right.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:46.400
Boo...  So much for gathering them.

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:10.350
We welcome you.

00:13:13.970 --> 00:13:16.360
So this is the Touda breeders' village?

00:13:16.360 --> 00:13:18.530
It's almost like a fortress.

00:13:18.530 --> 00:13:23.310
Yes.  The breeding method of Touda is our treasure.

00:13:23.310 --> 00:13:25.040
We're keeping it extra safe.

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:30.110
Even so, a life confined in a place like this must be very suffocating.

00:13:30.500 --> 00:13:33.530
Take me to the training grounds now.

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:36.460
And later, provide the people here with the goods we brought.

00:13:37.250 --> 00:13:41.230
Damiya-sama.  Such offerings to these people are unnecessary.

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:44.150
What's wrong?  It's only a small token of appreciation from me.

00:13:44.150 --> 00:13:46.250
I only need one cup.

00:13:46.720 --> 00:13:50.660
Chief.  Please entertain me well today.

00:13:50.660 --> 00:13:51.720
Most certainly.

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:01.870
Oh, sorry.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:04.700
I'm not good with the odor of Touda.

00:14:11.400 --> 00:14:12.460
What's that noise?

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:12.470
It's coming from the edge of the forest.
What's that noise?

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:14.250
It's coming from the edge of the forest.

00:14:20.440 --> 00:14:21.580
Let's go!

00:14:22.520 --> 00:14:23.820
Erin-chan!

00:14:24.130 --> 00:14:26.590
Hey!  Don't leave me behind!

00:14:33.550 --> 00:14:35.230
It's the training grounds!

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:01.510
He's wearing strange clothes.

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:03.050
You're right.

00:15:03.440 --> 00:15:06.430
The one next to him is the Grand Duke.

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.420
Look over there!

00:15:31.720 --> 00:15:32.750
Begin!

00:15:44.010 --> 00:15:45.050
It's a Kiba.

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:58.520
Awesome!

00:15:59.010 --> 00:16:00.370
Great.

00:16:04.620 --> 00:16:05.530
Next!

00:16:34.170 --> 00:16:36.370
Touda are so smart.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:38.310
They listen to anything.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:41.770
Saju, they listen to the people only because they're holding onto their horns.

00:16:42.340 --> 00:16:46.230
Touda are like toys if you can manipulate their horns correctly.

00:16:59.590 --> 00:17:02.580
I sort of... feel sorry for them.

00:17:17.440 --> 00:17:20.190
That fearsome Touda dropped instantaneously.

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.520
Is that the effect of the mute whistle?

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:24.760
Yes.

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:31.240
Refined skills, the mute whistle, and benetrophic water all help to create the strongest Touda.

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:36.840
Shunan!  Ngan!  Great work!

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:37.990
Step aside now.

00:17:38.330 --> 00:17:39.150
Yes, sir!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:44.580
The Queen's relative seems pleased.

00:17:44.580 --> 00:17:48.340
The training looks like a great success, Chief.

00:18:05.990 --> 00:18:07.910
C-Chief!

00:18:07.910 --> 00:18:10.860
What are you all doing?!  Make that Touda stop!

00:18:10.860 --> 00:18:12.380
Oh, no!

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.070
Erin-chan!

00:18:27.310 --> 00:18:29.600
Damiya-sama.  This way, please.

00:18:38.640 --> 00:18:39.770
Mom!

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:45.270
We have to open the Touda's ear covering!

00:18:46.080 --> 00:18:47.880
Her eye color...

00:18:47.880 --> 00:18:49.270
Is she an Arryo?

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:50.660
Ngan!

00:18:50.660 --> 00:18:51.510
Shunan-sama!

00:18:51.510 --> 00:18:52.610
Ngan-sama!

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:02.160
Ani-ue!

00:19:28.120 --> 00:19:31.650
Put that Touda on a wagon and take it slowly to the waterways.

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:32.810
Okay!

00:19:39.330 --> 00:19:40.360
Erin.

00:19:42.190 --> 00:19:45.270
My apologies, Damiya-sama.

00:19:46.070 --> 00:19:49.540
It's fine.  Happenings are expected in war.

00:19:49.900 --> 00:19:55.510
More importantly, I was able to see excellent proof of Shunan and Ngan's growth.

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:03.560
Chief.  Where did the Grand Duke go?

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:07.310
He just embarked back to the castle.

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.700
Luckily, he wasn't displeased about the training.

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.320
That's a relief.

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:18.300
But time is necessary to heal the wounded Touda.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.510
We'll have to raise more Touda.

00:20:21.510 --> 00:20:26.830
Then let's cut the baby Touda's ear-webs off and accelerate the breeding process.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:27.540
Yeah.

00:20:31.900 --> 00:20:34.670
What?  Cut Lulu's ear-webs off?

00:20:37.280 --> 00:20:38.040
Yeah.

00:20:38.570 --> 00:20:42.600
No!  Don't!  Please don't cut Lulu's ear-webs off!

00:20:43.180 --> 00:20:44.800
Please, mom.

00:20:45.350 --> 00:20:47.230
Please, mom.

00:20:49.740 --> 00:20:50.700
Erin...

00:20:52.510 --> 00:20:57.930
Touda that are in human hands can't live like other animals.

00:20:58.870 --> 00:21:04.540
It'll get its ear-webs cut someday.  Then
one day, it will get sent to war.

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:26.000
Hey, Mom.  Why do Touda fight?

00:21:26.760 --> 00:21:29.020
Is that the true nature of Touda?

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:33.670
I want to hear the Touda's words.

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:37.420
Then I'd understand their feelings.

00:21:47.790 --> 00:21:52.410
I don't want what happened today to happen to Lulu!

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:01.780
Erin...

00:22:08.590 --> 00:22:13.890
Erin's words reached Soyon's heart to the point that it was painful.

00:22:14.720 --> 00:22:18.740
However, Soyon knows better than anyone in the village

00:22:18.740 --> 00:22:25.240
that no one can live in this village without
using Touda as tools of war.

00:24:02.330 --> 00:24:05.640
My Onee-chan is going to go marry into another village.

00:24:05.640 --> 00:24:10.400
But Onee-chan is poisoned and
gets a terrible, high fever.

00:24:10.860 --> 00:24:16.030
Erin-chan and Soyon Oba-san decide to go find a remedy of the Mist People.

00:24:16.030 --> 00:24:18.740
Will they be able to get the medicine though?

00:24:19.760 --> 00:24:23.550
Kemono no Souja Erin.  Secret Within the Mist.

00:24:25.030 --> 00:24:30.030
Secret Within the Mist
